<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/432801ADGJGPHVLTBCRBHGKPBQGBDJSKM>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "2026 Exempt Holiday Party";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/a5f5950a-3173-4386-9561-9e4fd9e70db7.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>City of Kelowna presents</h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">The 2026 Exempt Holiday Party</span></h1><h2><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Presented by Corporate Services & Communications</span></span></h2></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>This holiday season, step into Alpine Après for a warm winter evening inspired by the relaxed elegance of a mountain lodge. Think glowing lights, evergreen touches, great food and great company, all coming together for an evening designed to exceed your expectations.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><ul><li> Saturday, November 28</li><li> 5:30 p.m. - 11 p.m.</li><li> Okanagan College</li></ul><span class=\"BoldText\">A night of gastronomy</span><span><br/></span>Come ready to eat well. Food will be at the heart of the evening, with a night of gastronomy designed for gathering, tasting and celebrating together. Settle in, explore what’s on offer and enjoy an evening of good food, conversation and a few surprises along the way.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Your $25 ticket includes:</span><span><br/></span><ul><li> A night of gastronomy</li><li> Two drink tickets</li><li> Entertainment throughout the evening</li><li> Transportation options to and from the event</li></ul>When purchasing your ticket, please be sure to let us know about any dietary restrictions so we can plan accordingly.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Enjoy the evening. We’ll help with the rest.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>We want everyone to be able to enjoy the evening from beginning to end. Taxi vouchers or a URIDE code will be available for travel from home to the event and back again.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Planning to make a night of it? A hotel block at the Coast Capri will also be available for those who would like to stay overnight.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>There’s no need to remember all the details just yet. Everyone who purchases a ticket will receive a Know Before You Go email closer to the event with transportation information, hotel details and everything else you need for the evening.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Ready for a little Alpine Après?</span><span><br/></span>Tickets are $25 + Fees<span><br/></span>Deadline to purchase your tickets is end of day Friday, November 6th<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>We hope you’ll join us as we trade the everyday for a little Alpine Après, gather around good food and celebrate the season together.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Warm. Refined. Unforgettable.
""";
