<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/428201ANNBDKRTCLJPMGQHBJBCKSPQSCB>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "2027 Central Okanagan Construction & Consulting Industry Engagement Seminar";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/436c3d60-54e5-45ce-bd0e-1da31cb83510.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>The City of Kelowna presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">CENTRAL OKANAGAN CONSTRUCTION & CONSULTING INDUSTRY ENGAGEMENT SEMINAR</span> </h1></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>Central Okanagan local governments will present an overview of major studies, designs and construction projects planned for 2027, with an emphasis on opportunities expected to enter the competitive market. The presentation will help contractors and consultants anticipate upcoming work and make informed decisions about potential bidding opportunities. Partners in last year’s presentation included the City of Kelowna, City of West Kelowna, District of Lake Country, FortisBC, Ministry of Transportation, Okanagan College, RDCO and UBCO. Additional municipalities and non-governmental organizations will also attend.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Refreshment breaks and lunch will be provided, with opportunities for one-on-one conversations.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Ticket proceeds cover the venue rental, food and beverages. Refunds will not be available after January 14, 2027.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Agenda: <span><br/></span>A detailed agenda will be shared when available.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Please note that your contact information will be shared for the purpose of seminar-related communications.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">General Admission  $129.20</span>  ($115.00 base price + $5.75 GST + $8.45 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">Central Okanagan Construction & Consulting Industry Engagement Seminar</span> tickets and their applicable fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
