<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/422601AVCTKJGJCTNNKJMTKVPCNCNHNTT>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Albertine en cinq temps - L’opèra";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/f74ff13f-48f0-4e99-a5ff-eb226d39db17.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>Opera Kelowna presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">ALBERTINE EN CINQ TEMPS - L’OPÈRA</span></h1></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>Albertine at 70 years old rehashes her memories.  At 30 years old, she already suspected that the immensity of the sky would never be able to contain her rage.  The archetype of the Québec Catholic working class mother from before the Quiet Revolution, Albertine places the spectators in the front row of her existence by revisiting key moments in her life, like so many dramatic strings from a bygone past.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This first opera in “joual” (French Québec dialect) lends a lyrical voice to Michel Tremblay‘s famous play Albertine en cinq temps. Six singers and five instrumentalists will give life to this bewitching music by composer Catherine Major to the libretto by Collectif de la Lune Rouge, staged by Nathalie Deschamps.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This 10 Avril production premiered in 2023. Opera Kelowna presents the Western Canadian premiere.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing <span class=\"ItalicText\">(Students: 25 and under, Senior: 65+)</span></h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"UnderlineText\">Tier 1</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Regular  $69.41</span>  ($58.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $9.05 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Senior  $62.51</span>  ($52.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $8.15 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Student  $59.41</span>  ($49.30 base price + $2.36 CIF + $7.75 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"UnderlineText\">Tier 2</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Regular  $48.71</span>  ($40.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $6.35 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Senior  $44.11</span>  ($36.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $5.75 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Student  $41.35</span>  ($33.60 base price + $2.36 CIF + $5.39 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"UnderlineText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">“Pay-What-You-Wish”</span></span><span><br/></span>$5.00  + $2.36 CIF + $1.31 service charge = <span class=\"BoldText\">$8.67</span><span><br/></span>$10.00 + $2.36 CIF + $1.58 service charge = <span class=\"BoldText\">$13.94</span><span><br/></span>$15.00 + $2.36 CIF + $1.84 service charge = <span class=\"BoldText\">$19.20</span><span><br/></span>$20.00 + $2.36 CIF + $2.10 service charge = <span class=\"BoldText\">$24.46</span><span><br/></span>$25.00 + $2.36 CIF + $2.36 service charge = <span class=\"BoldText\">$29.72</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices are CAD and include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Mary Irwin Theatre at the Rotary Centre for the Arts event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF). A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">Albertine en cinq temps - L’opèra</span> tickets and their applicable fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
