<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/430801ACVSGCLQSDGDCDPCKHLTPJSDSPJ>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Banff Mountain Film Festival World Tour Night 1";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/b5b40102-382a-407d-b6c2-86e9e9cb3039.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>Adaptive Adventures presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">BANFF MOUNTAIN FILM FESTIVAL WORLD TOUR</span></h1><h2><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Night 1</span></span></h2></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>This is for people who check the snow report before the news.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>For two nights, the Kelowna Community Theatre fills with folks just like you. The lights go down, and you’re on a mountain, a river nobody’s run, a ski line that makes the whole room go silent, and probably a few <span><br/></span>places you didn’t know existed.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Two nights. Two different lineups. One room full of people who’d rather be outside.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Each night is completely different, and no film plays twice. See one, and you’ll want to see them all, so buy both nights together for $70. When both events are in your cart the discount will automatically apply. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Better yet, bring your people: your ride group, your climbing partners, the paddling club, the whole office. Groups of ten or more get in for $35 a ticket. Discount will automatically apply when 10+ tickets are in your cart.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Every screening ends with a prize draw stacked with gear from World Tour sponsors.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Adaptive Adventures hosts these nights because the mountains should be open to everyone, and every ticket helps get more people out there.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Tickets (all fees included)<span><br/></span>One night $40 · Both nights $70 · Groups of 10+ $35 each<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Regular  $40.00</span>  ($32.73 base price + $2.36 CIF + $4.91 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices are in CAD and include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Kelowna Community Theatre event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF). A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">Banff Mountain Film Festival World Tour</span> tickets and service fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
  schema:startDate "2026-12-27T18:30:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
  schema:image <https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/b5b40102-382a-407d-b6c2-86e9e9cb3039.jpg>;
  schema:location <https://spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/location/201AGBHDRLQHNHPHKKMPKLGPMDRDTDMVL>;
  schema:organizer <https://spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/organization/adaptive-adventures>;
