<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/364401AQQPVSVVDVTPCJRGNDQTSBRKBQQ>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "CMK - Poiesis Quartet";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/ba33fb0e-504f-4501-b42c-e6ce31acaa68.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>Chamber Music Kelowna, Living Things, and the Rotary Centre for the Arts present</h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">POIESIS QUARTET</span></h1></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>Celebrated for their \"multifaceted artistry\" and \"brilliantly idiomatic\" programming (New York Times), the Poiesis Quartet is the winner of the 2026 Cleveland Quartet Award and the First Prize and Commission Prize recipients of the 2025 Banff International String Quartet Competition. In 2023, they were also named the Grand Prize and Lift Every Voice Prize winners of the Fischoff National Chamber Music Competition, as well as Gold Medal and BIPOC Prize winners at the 2023 St. Paul String Quartet Competition. In May 2024, Poiesis joined the Concert Artists Guild roster for North American management as winners of the Louis and Susan Meisel Competition.  <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Save 20% with an RCA Theatre Membership</span><span><br/></span>Want to save 20% on tickets to this show? Become an RCA Theatre Member for just $45 a year and enjoy exclusive savings and benefits throughout the season.<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.theboxoffice.ca/season-tickets/rca-presents\">Become a Theatre Member</a></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span class=\"BoldText\">Adult  $67.50</span>  ($56.34 base price + $2.36 CIF + $8.80 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Student (w/ID)  $25.00</span>  ($19.38 base price + $2.36 CIF + $3.26 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices are CAD and include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Mary Irwin Theatre at the Rotary Centre for the Arts event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF). A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">Poiesis Quartet</span> tickets and their applicable fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
