<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/417801ACDQTDSMVQDMBGNPDNVHGBHTVTC>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Couples Clownselling Valentine's Day: Love is a Joke";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/b2370d53-4d6e-4c5b-8b5c-16dd625fd7bd.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>This Thing On? presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">COUPLES CLOWNSELLING VALENTINE'S DAY</span></h1><h2><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Love is a Joke</span></span></h2></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">This is event is for ages 16+.</span></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Couples Clownselling Valentine’s Day: Love is a Joke!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Who is the best partner in the world? <span><br/></span>Who comes up with all the unique date ideas?<span><br/></span>Who is going to blow your spouse’s mind with totally-original-one-of-a-kind Valentine’s Day plans this year?!<span><br/></span>YOU! That’s who! (Once you secure your tickets to the biggest and funniest couples comedy show in the country!)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>It’s the show where stand-up comedians and their partners get therapized…by no one with a license. Real life couple and comedians Cass and Aaron invite you to voyeur an evening of domestic blunders, bloopers, and baggage, as we give comics and more importantly, their partners, the mic. Come watch as they air out their dirty laundry while receiving the best possible advice from the most (un)qualified, fully (not fully at all) licensed, (non)professionals. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>After 18 Sold-Out shows in Western Canada and fresh off the ‘Honk if Your Marriage is in Trouble’ Cross-Country tour, Couples Clownselling is hosting its BIGGEST show EVER in Kelowna, and on Valentine’s Day no less! This special presentation will be held at The Rotary Centre for the Arts, Mary Irwin Theatre - for one night only. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>We know what Valentine’s Day is really all about…winning. At least that’s what our therapist told us. Every year we mess around with chocolates, flowers, maybe a nice dinner here or there, but a couples comedy show where you can watch other people fight for a change?! That has Valentine’s Day Hall of Fame written all over it. And since this year, February 14th falls on the day before Family Day, you’ve got nothing to lose! Enjoy the night out guilt free, and cozy up with your cutie the next day to debrief on the drama and feel secure in your relationship.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The show has been featured on the CBC, Just For Laughs Vancouver, & the Georgia Straight. We have showcased Canada's top talent including several Juno Award Winners. This special presentation will feature local and touring professional comedians and their spouses. It is sponsored by family owned, locally crafted wellness and bath product company Soap Gurlz.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This show is recommended for ages <span class=\"BoldText\">16+</span>. It’s a live unscripted relationship comedy show, and things may get a little cheeky, a little spicy, and occasionally venture into more mature territory.<span><br/></span>If you’re planning on bringing your third-wheel teenager, be mindful that we will be playing with grown-up themes. Otherwise, grab your tickets, bring your sense of humour, and get ready for a good time!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>If you have any questions please email couplesclownselling@gmail.com<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Early Bird  $59.75</span>  ($49.60 base price + $2.36 CIF + $7.79 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Early Bird discount auto-applies until end of BOXING DAY, or until 100 tickets are sold, whichever comes first.</span></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Regular  $64.75</span>  ($53.94 base price + $2.36 CIF + $8.45 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Student w/ID  $39.50</span>  ($31.99 base price + $2.36 CIF + $5.15 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Limited Student tickets available!</span></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">VIP  $84.75</span>  ($71.34 base price + $2.36 CIF + $11.05 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">VIP ticket includes premium seating, \"Soap Gurlz\" Date Night Package, PLUS Couples Clownselling limited edition merch.</span></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices are CAD and include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Mary Irwin Theatre at the Rotary Centre for the Arts event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF). A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">Couples Clownselling Valentine's Day</span> tickets and their applicable fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
  schema:startDate "2027-02-14T19:30:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
  schema:image <https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/b2370d53-4d6e-4c5b-8b5c-16dd625fd7bd.jpg>;
