<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/433801AGPGSRQRVCCGDTCSGCNQSBHNGGD>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Crisprr - Beach Glass Tour";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/307a377a-f405-46c7-bba4-a488ab5a554a.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">CRISPRR</span></h1><h2><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Beach Glass Tour</span></span></h2></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>Since performing to sold-out shows on a 2026 West Coast tour with Montreal’s Black Dog, Crisprr has been locked away in the recording studio.  Please join us at the Kelowna Event Centre for our first major concert EXPERIENCE of 2027.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Grab your tickets now for this engaging, high-energy show. This is not just a rock concert.  You will experience world-class sound, the best wood-fired pizza you have ever eaten courtesy of <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.anticapizza.ca/\">&quot;Antico’s&quot;</a>, table service for premium wine and beer (no plastic cups!😎), intimate table seating, dance floor, and overall a memorable evening of top tier live music! Oh, and, GELATO!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>“We want our show to be an EXPERIENCE, not just a delivery of one song after the next. That's what we strive to achieve.  And we can’t wait to perform our new songs live.”<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://open.spotify.com/artist/4S8czdpeJpywYVvoUBCqxL\">Newly released music on Spotify</a><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ANnwq8Y3-Vg\">Live video from our West Coast tour</a><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ay6uQ-sX7M4\">Snow is Falling music video</a> – a 2026 OSIF awards finalist, and top-15% global streaming song on Spotify!\" <span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">With special guests</span> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/jordanbmakesmusic/\">Jordan B. and Aimee G.</a> Jordan has recently returned from five months performing and managing a music venue in Perú and is quickly gaining a following in BC. When teamed with Aimee they bring infectious energy and playful chemistry to the big stage! Expect dynamic guitar work, powerhouse blues vocals and creative takes on favorites from Bob Marley to Sam Roberts to the Beatles!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Grab your tickets and bring your friends because this is an evening you're sure to remember.  <span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">SPECIAL:</span> you told us you want to bring your kids!  For every adult ticket you may add one no-charge youth ticket – 18 and under. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Come discover why we were voted Kelowna’s 2026 Favourite Band!<span><br/></span>Want to reserve a table for 8? See the seating map here: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://crisprr.ca/beach-glass-tour-floor-layout/\">Beach Glass Tour Floor Layout | CRISPRR</a> then call or text Barry 250-575-6163 to reserve.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Regular  $39.00</span>  ($35.45 base price + $3.54 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Early Bird  $5.00 off for a limited time!</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Youth are free with a paying adult</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices are in CAD and include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">Crisprr</span> tickets and service fees are non-refundable.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">FAQ</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Are there assigned seats?<span><br/></span>Seating is first-come first serve, and the doors open at 7:00. There are NO bad seats in this beautiful venue!  Contact us if you want to reserve a table of 8 or 10.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Is the pizza good?<span><br/></span>Heck yah! This is no frozen supermarket stuff!  Tony takes his pizza VERY serious and we had a long talk about \"quality first\" before Antico agreed to join the fun.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>How many pizzas do we order?<span><br/></span>They are 12\".  Tony recommends one for dinner or 1/2 for a shared snack.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Are Jordan and Aimee good?<span><br/></span>Heck yah!  Strong and pleasant vocals, very articulate and detailed guitar work. What the critics have to say on the issue: <span class=\"ItalicText\">“Two distinct musical forces, one unpredictable duo. Fresh off five months performing and running a music venue in Peru, Jordan B brings dynamic guitar work and commanding vocals, while Aimee G delivers blues-infused powerhouse vocals, unmistakable style, and percussive flair. Together, they blend inventive musicianship, reimagined favourites, and playful stage chemistry. You never know what they’ll pull out next.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Are drinks affordable?<span><br/></span>$7.00 per glass for premium wine or beer?  Heck yah!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Can I bring my niece on the \"bring the family\" deal?<span><br/></span>Of course.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Gelato?<span><br/></span>Romulo Gelato will be onsite with their stylish gelato cart full of locally inspired flavors. Valentina was in Italy honing her gelato making skills and has been developing Okanagan inspired recipes to tantalize your taste buds. This is a special pre-launch \"sneak peek\" at what is sure to be your new summer frozen favorite.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Why Kelowna Event Centre?<span><br/></span>Where do I start lol!  With all their recent upgrades, Kelowna now has a beautiful venue with lots of space, table seating, probably the best sound and lighting in the valley, affordable table-served premium wine and beer, lots of parking, and convenient access from Harvey Ave.<span><br/></span> <span><br/></span> Is Darcy going to tell Dad jokes?<span><br/></span> Count on it.  I suggest you cheer us on for fast instrument changes to minimize the pain...
""";
