<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/434001ABKMHMQMLRHGGKJJGTGGLJRBCVQ>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Crisprr - Pizza Add-On";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">CRISPRR - Beach Glass Tour</span></h1><h2><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">PIZZA ADD-ON</span></span></h2></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>Since performing to sold-out shows on a 2026 West Coast tour with Montreal’s Black Dog, Crisprr has been locked away in the recording studio.  Please join us at the Kelowna Event Centre for our first major concert EXPERIENCE of 2027. Be sure to order yourself a pizza, created by Antico Pizza Neapoletana.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Is the pizza good?<span><br/></span>Heck yah! This is no frozen supermarket stuff!  Tony takes his pizza VERY serious and we had a long talk about \"quality first\" before Antico agreed to join the fun.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>How many pizzas do we order?<span><br/></span>They are 12\".  Tony recommends one for dinner or 1/2 for a shared snack.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Five options to choose from:<span><br/></span><ul><li>MARGHERITA (San Marzano tomato, Fior Di Latte, EVO, Basil - Vegetarian)</li><li>PEPPERONI (Pepperoni, San Marzano tomato sauce, Fior Di Latte, Basil)</li><li>ITALIAN SAUSAGE(Italian sausage, San Marzano tomato sauce)</li><li>HAM & PINEAPPLE (Cotto ham, fresh cut pineapple, San Marzano tomato sauce, Fior Di Latte, EVO, Basil)</li><li>GALLINA (Pesto, roasted chicken breast, sun dried tomato, Fior Di Latte) no sauce.</li></ul><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">$20.00 each</span>  ($19.05 base price + $0.95 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices are in CAD and include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">Crisprr Pizza Add-On</span> tickets and service fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
