<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/427201AGCHRSRBCTJCCKRHCRRRSHCHHGT>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Darcy & Jer - Average At Best Tour";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/89147509-9999-4ecf-87ef-8f3cfd648e63.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>Live Nation presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">DARCY & JER</span></h1><h2><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Average At Best Tour</span></span></h2></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>Fresh off a packed 2026 run, comedic married duo Darcy and Jer are extending their hit “Average at Best” tour into 2027 - because apparently none of us have learned our lesson. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Join Darcy and Jer for a night of hilarious stand up comedy from their neurodiverse marriage, adventures in middle age, family chaos, and the general indignities of trying to keep a relationship alive while spending this much time together. Relatable, ridiculous and occasionally raunchy, Darcy and Jer are bringing “Average at Best” to even more cities in 2027. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>More dates. More cities. Same marriage. Same disappointments. Somehow, even more material. Come see the internet’s favourite couple live in 2027. The show starts whenever they find parking. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">About Darcy & Jer:</span><span><br/></span>Together for over 20 years, Darcy & Jer are first and foremost proud dads to their daughter Grace and their golden retriever Yuma. And second, they’re idiots on the internet. Known for their hilarious videos around their relationship, mental health, plants and more, Darcy & Jer have quickly become household names with a global audience. In 2024 Tiktok chose Darcy & Jer as their Visionary Voice saying to the Today Show “their hilarious videos about each other will crack you up and warm your heart.”<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>With over 7 million followers across platforms and over a billion views on their videos, Darcy Michael and Jeremy Baer have become leaders in comedy content creation. Their comedy has allowed them to build a community that celebrates conversations around mental health and relationships. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>With Darcy having ADHD and the pair being members of the LGTBQ+ community, Darcy and Jer aim to create an inclusive, safe environment celebrating life with neurodivergence. Darcy and Jer’s sense of humour, joyful personalities, and unique content continues to build them an adoring fanbase. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Aiming to grow beyond their online content, in 2023 Darcy & Jer debuted their live comedy show at the Just for Laughs Vancouver Festival to a sold-out crowd of 1200 fans. From the success of that show, they launched a small 6 date tour called “No Refunds” that quickly grew to over 50 cities across North America, including making their debut on Broadway in New York City. In 2024, they expanded the tour to the UK and Ireland. With over 50,000 tickets sold, their dynamic chemistry, candid humor, and infectious energy made the tour a smash hit. Adding to his achievements, their acclaimed comedy special, NO REFUNDS, and a behind-the-scenes documentary, HAPPILY EVER LAUGHTER, are now available on Crave and World of Wonder. Their “No Refunds Album” stand-up comedy album reached #1 in North America on the comedy charts and even cracked the top 20 for all albums, it is available to stream everywhere.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>In 2026, Darcy became a Best-Selling Author, with the release of his debut memoir, ATTENTION SEEKER: A Neurodivergent Comedian’s Guide to Thriving with ADHD. It reached the Amazon best seller list on the first day of presales and is currently on the Globe and Mail’s Best Seller list for its 4th weeks in a row.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>In early 2026, Darcy & Jer embarked on their second tour, “Average at Best” across North America, which is full of all new material and the same old disappointments. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Regular  $54.69</span>  ($45.50 base price + $2.36 CIF + $6.83 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 2  $44.34</span>  ($36.50 base price + $2.36 CIF + $5.48 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">VIP Package  $196.29</span>  ($169.50 base price + $2.36 CIF + $24.43 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"UnderlineText\">VIP Package Info</span><span><br/></span>- One seat in the first five rows <span><br/></span>- Meet and Greet with Darcy & Jer<span><br/></span>- Individual photograph opportunity with Darcy & Jer<span><br/></span>- Priority Merchandise shopping before doors open to the general public<span><br/></span>- Exclusive Limited Edition Signed Lithograph<span><br/></span>- One Commemorative VIP Laminate & Lanyard<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices are in CAD and include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Kelowna Community Theatre event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF). A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">Darcy & Jer</span> tickets and their applicable service fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
