<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/434601ABKLNMNHGSLMQCMGGDLGBPCCTPS>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "DBX - The Doobie Brothers Experience";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/0f1f060a-7b5c-4072-b4d4-9d3a0a47f171.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>DBX presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">DBX - THE DOOBIE BROTHERS EXPERIENCE</span></h1></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>“DBX – The Doobie Brothers Experience” – is Canada’s premier tribute to The Doobie Brothers. Look-a-likes of Tom Johnston and Pat Simmons with vocal similarities and soaring vocal harmonies, are the band’s hallmarks and the foundation to which their performance has been built.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>“DBX” brings the sound, energy, and legacy of one of rock’s most iconic bands to life on stage. “DBX” doesn’t just perform the music – they recreate the experience…<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>With one of the most “game-changing” song catalogues in rock and roll history from the Tom Johnston era to the Michael McDonald era, “DBX” has evolved into a masterful celebration of The Doobie Brothers. All rock enthusiasts know the words to “China Grove”; “Long Train Runnin’“; “What A Fool Believes”; “Black Water”; “Takin’ It To The Streets”, or “Minute By Minute” and many, many more.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>If you love The Doobie Brothers, then welcome to an evening with “DBX – The Doobie Brothers Experience”, and “Listen To The Music”…<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Website: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://thedoobiebrothersexperience.com/\">https://thedoobiebrothersexperience.com/</a><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Promo video: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=i48q8rZOLBo\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=i48q8rZOLBo</a><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Regular  $51.01</span>  ($42.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $6.65 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices are in CAD and include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Mary Irwin Theatre at the Rotary Centre for the Arts event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF). A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">DBX - The Doobie Brothers Experience</span> tickets and their applicable fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
