<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/433201ATRTHRNHKCGDVQCKSCBQVRMRCTQ>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Downtown After 5 - December";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/6b52e317-5935-431c-9a3f-464ee7ed81fb.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>Downtown Kelowna Association presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">DOWNTOWN AFTER 5 - December 2026</span></h1><h2><span class=\"ItalicText\"> Hosted by the DKA at the Kelowna Yacht Club</span></h2></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>Wrap up the year with Downtown After 5 at the Kelowna Yacht Club!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Kelowna’s best business casual mixer, Downtown Kelowna After 5, turns traditional networking into a chance to unwind and get to know your neighbours. After 5 brings our business community together to connect, collaborate, and build lasting relationships in a relaxed, social setting.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Admission to the hottest post-work party in town is only $20.00 per person and includes appies and two (2) complimentary drink tickets.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Downtown After 5 is a 19+ event; guests may be asked for ID to verify their age. Guests refusing a request for ID will not be served.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">See you ‘After 5’!</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Note:</span> A reminder that two drink tickets per person are allotted; additional drink tickets are not available for sale and are non-transferrable. Drink tickets can only be redeemed at the event venue during the event.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span class=\"BoldText\">General Admission</span> CA$20.00 ($17.37 + $2.63 Ticketing fee)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Maximum limit of 5 tickets per party at this time. Additional tickets purchased will be refunded without fees. A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Downtown After 5</span> tickets and their applicable fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
