<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/435202ANDLJQPJRHBQJDRJPPLMPJLQNVH>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Headpins - Platinum Record Canadian Rockers";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/31eaec95-e3e6-49a4-a78d-813916c679ab.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>Scotty Dog Entertainment Ltd. presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">HEADPINS</span></h1><h2><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Platinum Record Canadian Rockers</span></span></h2></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>Legendary Canadian rock band known for their electrifying fusion of hard rock and bluesy melodies, powerful vocals and captivating stage presence. HEADPINS Bring their multi Platinum & Gold albums and chart topping hits.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Timeless rockers like “Don’t it make ya Feel”, “Just One More Time”, Turn it Loud”, “Breakin’ Down”, “Feel My Body”, “Winnin’”. Co-founded by Brian Macleod & Ab Bryant in 1980, the group quickly gained popularity and became a driving force on the Canadian music scene and still deliver the hits with the same punch as when the songs were first penned!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>You Will Be Rocked!!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Premium (first two rows)  $99.95</span>  ($84.86 base price + $2.36 CIF + $12.73 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 1  $89.95</span>  ($76.17 base price + $2.36 CIF + $11.42 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 2  $84.95</span>  ($71.82 base price + $2.36 CIF + $10.77 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 3  $79.95</span>  ($67.47 base price + $2.36 CIF + $10.12 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 4  $69.95</span>  ($58.77 base price + $2.36 CIF + $8.82 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices are in CAD and include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Kelowna Community Theatre event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF). A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">Headpins</span> tickets and their applicable service fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
