  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">HEADPINS</span></h1><h1><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">VIP Add-On</span></span></h1></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">This is NOT a ticket to the Headpins concert. You cannot purchase a VIP add-on without a ticket to the Headpins concert.</span></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The Headpins VIP Add-On includes:<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>- Meet and Greet<span><br/></span>- Photo opportunity<span><br/></span>- Tour shirt<span><br/></span>- Poster signing<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Headpins VIP Add-On  $67.85</span>  ($59.00 base price + $8.85 service charges)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices are in CAD and include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">Headpins VIP Add-On</span> tickets and their applicable service fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
