		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>MULTI Platinum Recording Artists HONEYMOON SUITE will be rockin’ The Kelowna Community Theatre with their heap of classic hits \"New Girl Now\", \"Burning in Love\", \"Wave Babies\", \"Stay in the Light\", etc.<span><br/></span>The band's original classic lineup deliver the goods like the day the songs were pressed!! An intimate night of nostalgia NOT to be missed!!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Premium (first two rows)  $109.95</span>  ($93.56 base price + $2.36 CIF + $14.03 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 1  $99.95</span>  ($84.86 base price + $2.36 CIF + $12.73 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 2  $89.95</span>  ($76.17 base price + $2.36 CIF + $11.42 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 3  $79.95</span>  ($67.47 base price + $2.36 CIF + $10.12 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 4  $69.95</span>  ($58.77 base price + $2.36 CIF + $8.82 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices are in CAD and include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Kelowna Community Theatre event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF). A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">Honeymoon Suite</span> tickets and their applicable service fees are non-refundable.</span>
