<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/427001ADJQSPHKCBDVDJNMKVQLPMLKJDT>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Ken's Kings Night 2nd Anniversary Showcase";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/f5fb09a4-2021-443c-8eb1-9034c30db62e.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>Inspired Word Cafe presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">KEN'S KINGS NIGHT</span></h1><h2><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">2nd Anniversary Showcase</span></span></h2></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">This is a 19+ event.</span></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Ken’s Kings and Things Night is celebrating its two-year anniversary with an incredible showcase of local drag talent plus an extra fabulous queer Open Mic presented by Inspired Word Café! This show will celebrate KENDONTCRY and the vibrant drag king and thing scene here in the Okanagan—a full night of gender-bending, ridiculous masculinity, and queer art.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This showcase will feature an 8-spot open mic with a focus on gender expression, plus drag performances by Bummer, Walter Wilcox, Other Nature, Jovian, Stud Sparkles, Catastrophe and KENDONTCRY. With extra special guest from Vancouver, nonbinary trans masc Korean Lesbian Drag King, SKIM!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span class=\"BoldText\">General Admission  $30.00</span>  ($27.27 base price + $2.73 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Day-of event  $35.00</span>  ($31.82 base price + $3.18 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices are in CAD and include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">Ken's Kings Night</span> tickets and service fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
