<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/433001ADCHCQMRKKJTNCKDHDQDQCBSTMC>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "La Vie Bohème: A screening of Rent in support of Opera Kelowna";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/57171575-e61f-440d-a0b7-a6b0ff787d73.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>Opera Kelowna presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">LA VIE BOHÈME</span></h1><h2><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">A screening of \"RENT\" in support of Opera Kelowna</span></span></h2></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>Celebrate the season with a unique night out.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Jonathan Larson’s groundbreaking 1996 rock musical was made into a film in 2005, thus continuing the robust tradition of adapting Giacomo Puccini’s world-famous opera <span class=\"ItalicText\">La Bohème</span>. In support of Opera Kelowna’s upcoming production of the opera next August, we invite you to take in the musical it inspired!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Enjoy delicious refreshments in the upper lobby from 6:30-7:00pm, and a musical welcome from the inimitable singer and <span class=\"ItalicText\">Rent</span>-enthusiast Melina Schein. Then join host Rosemary Thomson and the Opera Kelowna team for a screening of <span class=\"ItalicText\">Rent</span>. Attendees will also have an on-site opportunity to donate to Opera Kelowna (CRA number 891 581 448) in a game-like setting in the lobby.  <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Seating is general admission.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Singing along is welcome but 100% optional (we invite enthusiasts to sit at the front).<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Taking a breath this busy holiday season to experience the humour, compassion, and beauty of Rent is highly recommended.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Donations will be gratefully accepted on site.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>For more information please visit <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.operakelowna.com/\">www.operakelowna.com</a><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Regular  $32.36</span>  ($25.78 base price + $2.36 CIF + $4.22 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices are in CAD and include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Mary Irwin Theatre at the Rotary Centre for the Arts event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF). A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes.  <span class=\"BoldText\">La Vie Bohème</span> tickets and their applicable fees are non-refundable.</span><span><br/></span>
""";
