		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span><h2>featuring <span class=\"ItalicText\">the Gary Cable Project</span> and Special Musical Guests</h2><span><br/></span>Back by popular demand! The Gary Cable Project makes its return to the Kelowna Community Theatre with Legendary Rock Live! The 'Project returns to the Okanagan with its world-class horn section, the Project Horns, to perform some of the greatest music ever made - Chicago, Whitney Houston, Foreigner, Gerry Rafferty, Gino Vannelli, Supertramp, Sade, Toto, Seals & Croft, and more! Don't miss this unforgettable night of \"Legendary Music by Legendary Musicians\"!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Comprised of Canada’s top live and session players, The Gary Cable Project is a 9-piece band including full horn section; an All-Star group of musicians who have recorded and performed and toured with the legends Barbra Streisand, Bryan Adams, Aerosmith, Chilliwack, the Pointer Sisters, Sarah McLachlan, David Foster, the Powder Blues, Stuart Copeland (the Police), David Clayton-Thomas/Blood Sweat and Tears, Long John Baldry, Jann Arden, Colin James, Michael Bublé — to name a few. 2 members of the group are already members of the Canadian Music Hall of Fame for their work with Trooper and Chilliwack. You do not want to miss this Tour!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Proudly sponsored by:	Harmony Acura, Bekins Moving & Storage, ChocXO Chocolatiers, AgentixGo SEO, and Wentworth Music. <span><br/></span>Media sponsors:	 	OV103.9, The Beach 103.1, Kelowna Capital News, and Castanet.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>All concert and silent auction proceeds benefit Okanagan charities through The Gary Cable Foundation. Over the past 4 years <span class=\"ItalicText\">Gary Cable Project</span> concerts have raised more than $100,000 for BC community charities.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"UnderlineText\">Use Early Bird discount code <span class=\"BoldText\">ORO</span> to save 10% off all tickets purchased through October 31, 2026.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>For more information: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.garycableproject.com/\">www.garycableproject.com</a><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span class=\"UnderlineText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 1</span></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Adult  $84.75</span>  ($71.64 base price + $2.36 CIF + $10.75 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Senior  $74.40</span>  ($62.64 base price + $2.36 CIF + $9.40 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Youth  $41.05</span>  ($33.64 base price + $2.36 CIF + $5.05 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"UnderlineText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 2</span></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Adult  $75.55</span>  ($63.64 base price + $2.36 CIF + $9.55 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Senior  $65.20</span>  ($54.64 base price + $2.36 CIF + $8.20 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Youth  $38.75</span>  ($31.64 base price + $2.36 CIF + $4.75 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"UnderlineText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 3</span></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Adult  $43.36</span>  ($35.64 base price + $2.36 CIF + $5.36 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Senior  $39.90</span>  ($32.64 base price + $2.36 CIF + $4.90 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Youth  $36.45</span>  ($29.64 base price + $2.36 CIF + $4.45 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices are in CAD and include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Kelowna Community Theatre event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF). A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">Legendary Rock Live</span> tickets and their applicable fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
