<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/423001ADMBCSGGCBPDBLSHSSCBVRHVMTM>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "LIPS - The Ultimate Rolling Stones Experience";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/93503ffd-a52e-4b68-b4d4-46c8e25b7163.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>The Canadian Bluemoon Ventures Ltd. presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">LIPS</span></h1><h2>The Ultimate Rolling Stones Experience</h2></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>Imagine it's 1964. There has been a seismic shift in North American<span><br/></span>popular music. The British Invasion has arrived!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>LIPS - The Ultimate Rolling Stones Experience are a group of veteran<span><br/></span>musicians that will take you back to the glory days of one of the<span><br/></span>greatest Rock and Roll bands in history - The Rolling Stones! With two<span><br/></span>powerhouse female background vocalists and an amazing horn section,<span><br/></span>this will be a night you won't forget. You'll be blown away with England<span><br/></span>born-and-raised frontman Brian Dean's resemblance to Sir Mick<span><br/></span>Jagger, how he encapsulates his sound, and of course, his moves.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Now, re-experience all of the nostalgia, costumes, and excitement of<span><br/></span>an electrifying Rock and Roll extravaganza! Playing all of the hits and<span><br/></span>some deep cuts from all Stones eras, plus songs from the Stones' latest<span><br/></span>album, \"Hackney Diamonds\" (including \"Sweet Sounds of Heaven\", a<span><br/></span>duet with Lady Gaga), you are sure to get some \"Satisfaction\"!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Regular  $66.70</span>  ($55.95 base price + $2.36 CIF + $8.39 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices are in CAD and include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Kelowna Community Theatre event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF) and. A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">LIPS - The Ultimate Rolling Stones Experience</span> tickets and their applicable service fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
