<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/431801ASBMQBGRRRRNPMSVRBRKRNJPJLL>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Living Things Festival - Baleines - Video installation by Compagnie Mossoux-Bonté";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/4fd52c1c-4fe0-4ecc-b48a-3972abf118bd.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>Living Things Festival presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">BALEINES</span></h1><h2>By Compagnie Moscou-Bonté</h2></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>Video Installation // Belgium<span><br/></span>January 23 at the Kelowna Community Theatre<span><br/></span>Showings at 2, 3, 4, and 5pm<span><br/></span>For all audiences.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>An immersion. A drifting of the mind, a siren's reverie that overturns fluid dynamics and invents the laws of weightlessness. Sunken cathedrals, faceless beauties wandering endlessly on a motionless journey. Stardust in the ocean's womb, up and down, the vertical slumber of whales.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Baleines is an invitation to detach yourself briefly from the clutches of global connectivity, settle comfortably into chairs, couches, and cushions, surrounded by soft darkness, and immerse yourself in these extraordinary images and sounds. Unforgettable beauty.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Baleines has won:<span><br/></span>Inspiring Art Award at the MANIFEST Dance Film Festival (Tamil Nadu, India) - 2026<span><br/></span>Best Cinematography Award at the Breaking Walls Festival (Cairo, Egypt) - 2026<span><br/></span>Best International Film at the DESASSOSSEGO Video-Dance Short Film Festival (Porto, Portugal) - 2025<span><br/></span>Best Film at the Bucharest International Dance Film Festival (Romania) - 2025<span><br/></span>Best Video-Dance Film at the D'Ohlar Itinerant Dance and Video Festival (Goiânia, Brazil) - 2025<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Duration: 30 mins<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>INCLUSIVE PRICING*<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>In a spririt of openness and accessibility, we invite everyone to choose the ticket price that best suits their situation.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Discounted tickets for students are available on the website or at the theatre's Box Office.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Living Things is presented by Inner Fish Performance, a Kelowna-based non-profit performing arts organization.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Supporter</span> <span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">I would like to support inclusive pricing and help make lower-priced tickets available to others.</span>  <span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">$31.11</span>  ($25.00 base price + $2.36 CIF  + $3.75 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Regular</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">I would like to support arts and culture in Kelowna and am able to pay the full price of a ticket.</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">$23.06</span>  ($18.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $2.70 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Reduced</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">I have a limited budget for cultural activities but don't want to miss out.</span> <span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">$17.49</span>  ($12.50 base price + $2.36 CIF + $2.63 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Student</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">I am a student and would like to enjoy arts and culture at an affordable price.</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">$17.49</span>  ($12.50 base price + $2.36 CIF + $2.63 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Kelowna Community Theatre event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF). A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">Baleines</span> tickets and their applicable fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
