<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/432601ADJQSRBPCMTVRRBSPQQMHLRGDPK>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Living Things Festival - Latin Dance Party! (19+)";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/747cce70-4452-4f9a-a2a4-5954a2d10b5d.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>Living Things Festival, in collaboration with Latin Voices Society and Baila Kelowna, presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">LATIN DANCE PARTY!</span></h1></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>January 23 at Black Box Theatre<span><br/></span>Open doors at 6:30pm<span><br/></span>Beginner Latin Dance Lesson at 7:00pm<span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">19+ event. Valid government-issued ID may be required.</span></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Join us for a night of Latin music and dance as the Living Things Festival celebrates 11 years of presenting bold, contemporary performing arts in Kelowna. In collaboration with Latin Voices Society and Baila Kelowna, we invite you to come celebrate with us!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>This party brings our community together to celebrate the performing arts, audiences, collaborators, and supporters who have helped shape Living Things into one of Kelowna's signature cultural events.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Kelowna-based Cuban music ensemble Alma Cubana will perform live, bringing the rhythms and energy of Cuban music to the dance floor.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Before the party get underway, Baila Kelowna will lead a beginner's Latin Dance lesson for anyone who wants to learn some moves and get ready for the dance floor. No previous dance experience is required.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Special surprises will be announced soon - expect a vibrant, celebratory atmosphere fill with performing arts, community, live music, and dance!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Come celebrate the past, present, and future of Living Things with us.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>INCLUSIVE PRICING*<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>In a spririt of openness and accessibility, we invite everyone to choose the ticket price that best suits their situation.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Living Things is presented by Inner Fish Performance, a Kelowna-based non-profit performing arts organization.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Supporter</span> <span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">I would like to support inclusive pricing and help make lower-priced tickets available to others.</span>  <span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">$44.00</span>  ($40.00 base price + $4.00 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Regular</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">I would like to support arts and culture in Kelowna and am able to pay the full price of a ticket.</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">$30.80</span>  ($28.00 base price + $2.80 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Reduced</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">I have a limited budget for cultural activities but don't want to miss out.</span> <span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">$22.63</span>  ($20.00 base price + $2.63 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Student</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">I am a student and would like to enjoy arts and culture at an affordable price.</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">$22.63</span>  ($20.00 base price + $2.63 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">Latin Dance Party!</span> tickets and their applicable fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
