<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/429001ASCRKCRSKHTJSPKHTCSVBBKQSTM>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Living Things Festival - Right in the Eye - Movie Concert";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/7d1dca68-3a1e-4c6c-b517-5540c7c13ce6.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>Living Things Festival presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">RIGHT IN THE EYE MOVIE-CONCERT</span></h1></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>Movie - Concert // France<span><br/></span>January 27, 7:00 PM at the Mary Irwin Theatre<span><br/></span>For all audiences.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Right in the Eye, by Jean-François Alcoléa, is a movie-concert inspired by the films of Georges Méliès. Bringing to life the fantastical worlds of films such as The Impossible Voyage and the burlesque humour of shorts like The Four Troublesome Heads, Right in the Eye offers a poetic, playful, and contemporary interpretation of Méliès' timeless work.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Lighting and scenic design combine to create a distinctive visual identity, making Right in the Eye much more than a movie-concert—it is a richly imaginative and poetic theatrical experience. An original score has been composed for each film, giving every piece its own unique musical identity while seamlessly integrating it into the production as a whole.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>It is inventive, elegant and moving…Right to one’s core !<span><br/></span>- CHRONIQUE FESTIVAL AVIGNON - <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>A delightful and entertaining opportunity to discover the early days of cinema.<span><br/></span>- LA NOUVELLE RÉPUBLIQUE - <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>OVER 100,000 SPECTATORS in France and abroad!<span><br/></span>If imagination were to become manifest, it would not be surprising if it took the form of Georges Méliès. Considered by the Lumière brothers as the “creator of cinematic spectacle,” Méliès can best be described through any number of superlatives. He was an inventive pioneer, an emblematic figure and a brilliant entertainer who, in just a few years, revealed the full extent of his visionary genius—only to end up impoverished and largely forgotten.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Right in the Eye Video Trailer: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://vimeo.com/1218190973/94ab3bb558?fl=ip&amp;fe=ec&amp;share=copy\">https://vimeo.com/1218190973/94ab3bb558?fl=ip&amp;fe=ec&amp;share=copy</a><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2>INCLUSIVE PRICING*<span><br/></span>In a spirit of openness and accessibility, we invite everyone to choose the ticket price that best suits their situation.<span><br/></span> <span><br/></span>Half-priced tickets are available for students on the website or at the theatre’s Box Office.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Presented by Living Things with support by BC Live Performance Network.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Living Things is presented by Inner Fish Performance, a Kelowna-based non-profit performing arts organization.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Supporter</span> <span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">I would like to support inclusive pricing and help make lower-priced tickets available to others.</span>  <span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">$65.96</span>  ($55.00 base price + $2.36 CIF  + $8.60 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Regular</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">I would like to support arts and culture in Kelowna and am able to pay the full price of a ticket.</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">$48.71</span>  ($40.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $6.35 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Student</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">I am a student and would like to enjoy arts and culture at an affordable price.</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">$25.71</span>  ($20.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $3.35 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Reduced Rate</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">I have a limited budget for cultural activities but don't want to miss out.</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">$25.71</span>  ($20.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $3.35 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Mary Irwin Theatre at the Rotary Centre for the Arts event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF). A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">Right in the Eye</span> tickets and their applicable fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
  schema:startDate "2027-01-27T19:00:00"^^xsd:dateTime;
  schema:image <https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/7d1dca68-3a1e-4c6c-b517-5540c7c13ce6.jpg>;
