	</table><span><br/></span>New World Men – The Sound Of Rush, offers a stunningly accurate performance of the Rush classics. They are considered by many to be the very best Rush tribute act today. The band offers top class sound quality and stellar musicianship, nested in a high-tech multimedia experience. All of which is delivered with a contagious energy that leaves fans wanting more.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Watch: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9nTzQk9Eq8s\"> New World Men - Rush Spirit of Radio LIVE</a><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Regular  $59.00</span>  ($48.94 base price + $2.36 CIF + $7.70 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Mary Irwin Theatre event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF). A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">New World Men</span> tickets and their applicable fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
