<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/427601AMDTDHCSPKTNCGHMSGQMJRQDDQM>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "NOW CLAP! Bob The Drag Queen's on Tour";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/77922207-a9d3-433b-b4ec-704c288dd55a.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>Show and Tell presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">NOW CLAP!</span></h1><h2><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">Bob The Drag Queen's on Tour</span></span></h2></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">This event is for ages 18+.</span></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>IYKYK and if you don't, you better come to the show and find out! Put your hands together because the stage is about to be graced by more than just your average touring comedian. Bask in the glow of a Broadway star, New York Times best-selling author, Traitor, Hulu stand-up, Drag Race winner, and so much more. Now Clap! Bob the Drag Queen is on Tour!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Over the past few years, Bob the Drag Queen has not had much downtime between releasing his comedy special on Hulu \"This is Wild!\", making his Broadway debut as Zidler in Moulin Rouge! The Musical, completing a world comedy tour, attempting murder on the third season of Peacock’s “The Traitors,” starting his production company \"Purse First Studios,\" and writing the NYT bestselling debut novel “Harriet Tubman: Live In Concert\". That’s in addition to all the other projects you know and love him for: RuPaul’s Drag Race, the Sibling Rivalry podcast, and hosting Madonna’s 2023-2024 Celebration tour. Bob has become one of comedy's biggest crossover acts, proven by countless sold-out clubs and theaters. Even people who don't like stand-up comedy or have never seen Drag Race leave wanting more - come see for yourself!<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">VIP Meet and Greet Package  $199.59</span>  ($171.50 base price + $2.36 CIF + $25.73 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"UnderlineText\">VIP Meet & Greet Package includes:</span><span><br/></span>- One (1) Prime Seat<span><br/></span>- Access to Pre-Show Meet and Greet<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 1  $102.99</span>  ($87.50 base price + $2.36 CIF + $13.13 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 2  $74.24</span>  ($62.50 base price + $2.36 CIF + $9.38 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 3  $45.49</span>  ($37.50 base price + $2.36 CIF + $5.63 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices are in CAD and include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Kelowna Community Theatre event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF). A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">NOW CLAP! Bob The Drag Queen's on Tour</span> tickets and their applicable service fees are non-refundable.</span><span><br/></span>
""";
