<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/416401AKKMVBGJBBNMLBQJKRGBDBBKKNT>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Queen: A Night with the Opera ";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/0a869354-3924-4847-8199-427bd371549b.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>Opera Kelowna presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">Queen:</span> </h1><h2><span class=\"ItalicText\">A Night with the Opera</span></h2></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>Back by popular demand! This unique concert experience celebrates the music of Queen with distinctly operatic flourish. We brings together the Gary Cable Project with one of Canada’s most exciting and innovative opera singers, Teiya Kasahara 笠原貞野, taking on lead vocals made immortal by Freddie Mercury. Under the musical direction of Rosemary Thomson, performances will also feature six Bohemian Backup Singers sprinkling in a few opera gems, backed up by both The Gary Cable Project rockers and Their Majesty’s Strings.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>With hits like Somebody to Love and Bohemian Rhapsody mixed in with a selection of tunes from deep within the Queen catalogue -- and a few opera gems as well -- this performance offers Okanagan audiences a unique experience. Our performers deliver the vocal dexterity, instrumental virtuosity, and dynamic energy that Queen’s music shares with the world of opera.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing <span class=\"ItalicText\">(Students: 25 and under, Senior: 65+)</span></h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"UnderlineText\">Tier 1</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Adult  $86.31</span>  ($73.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $10.95 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Senior  $77.92</span>  ($65.70 base price + $2.36 CIF + $9.86 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Student  $73.72</span>  ($62.05 base price + $2.36 CIF + $9.31 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"UnderlineText\">Tier 2</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Adult  $77.11</span>  ($65.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $9.75 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Senior  $69.64</span>  ($58.50 base price + $2.36 CIF + $8.78 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Student  $65.90</span>  ($55.25 base price + $2.36 CIF + $8.29 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"UnderlineText\">Tier 3</span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Adult  $46.06</span>  ($38.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $5.70 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Senior  $41.69</span>  ($34.20 base price + $2.36 CIF + $5.13 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Student  $39.51</span>  ($32.30 base price + $2.36 CIF + $4.85 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">(Senior - 65+, Student must have student ID)</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"UnderlineText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">“Pay-What-You-Wish”</span></span><span><br/></span>$5.00 + $2.36 CIF + $1.31 service charge = <span class=\"BoldText\">$8.67</span><span><br/></span>$10.00 + $2.36 CIF + $1.58 service charge = <span class=\"BoldText\">$13.94</span><span><br/></span>$15.00 + $2.36 CIF + $1.84 service charge = <span class=\"BoldText\">$19.20</span><span><br/></span>$20.00 + $2.36 CIF + $2.10 service charge = <span class=\"BoldText\">$24.46</span><span><br/></span>$25.00 + $2.36 CIF + $2.36 service charge = <span class=\"BoldText\">$29.72</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">*limited pay-what-you-wish tickets available.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices include GST</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Kelowna Community Theatre event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF). A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">Queen: A Night with the Opera</span> tickets and their applicable fees are non-refundable.</span><span><br/></span>
""";
