  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "RCA Presents - Séan McCann";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/577246af-77ce-4bc5-a8d0-264242ded728.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>Rotary Centre for the Arts presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">SÉAN McCANN</span></h1><h2><span class=\"ItalicText\">Sink or Swim</span></h2></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Save 20% with an RCA Theatre Membership</span><span><br/></span>Want to save 20% on tickets to this show? Become an RCA Theatre Member for just $45 a year and enjoy exclusive savings and benefits throughout the season.<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.theboxoffice.ca/season-tickets/rca-presents\">Become a Theatre Member</a></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>SÉAN McCANN, The Shantyman of GREAT BIG SEA, returns with a new set of original songs, alongside the trusted favourites audiences know and love, for anyone feeling overwhelmed by the moment we’re living in. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Between constant noise, relentless headlines, and the pressure to keep moving without pause, SINK OR SWIM asks a simple but vital question: how do we stay afloat when the world feels louder, faster and heavier by the day. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Armed only with his guitar, and an unwavering commitment to truth, Séan invites audiences into a shared space of reflection, resilience, and release where singing isn’t optional, it’s essential. These are songs about the undertow and what we do to resist it. About finding your breath when everything feels urgent. About choosing presence over panic, connection over isolation, and humanity over noise. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Come as you are.  Leave a little lighter. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>To learn more about Séan McCann, visit <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://seanmccannsings.com/\">seanmccannsings.com</a>.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span class=\"BoldText\">Adult  $63.09</span>  ($52.50 base price + $2.36 CIF + $8.23 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Student w/ID  $32.90</span>  ($26.25 base price + $2.36 CIF + $4.29 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Mary Irwin Theatre at the Rotary Centre for the Arts event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF). A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">Séan McCann</span> tickets and their applicable fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
