<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/424001ADHDPJSKDNPLPMMHMTCMJJBDLCT>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "The Irish Rovers";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/9bf58323-257d-45dd-bdf1-e30c67211008.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>What's On? Events Inc. presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">THE IRISH ROVERS</span></h1></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>Rovers fans can look forward to a classic Irish Rovers concert already set to be memorable for the 2027 tour—a night packed with hits, the latest Rovers material, lots of laughs and colourful stories from more than six decades of roving. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Stars of television and stage, The Irish Rovers continue to entertain while gaining generations of fans into their 60th year. They are widely known for popularizing Irish music across North America with their international television series and worldwide touring. Their new “The Belfast Sessions” cd, recorded in Belfast at RedBox Studios, will be released on tour.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Babes in arms are permitted for this event. Check in at the Box Office on arrival at the theatre. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Regular  $69.00</span>  ($57.95 base price + $2.36 CIF + $8.69 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices are in CAD and include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Kelowna Community Theatre event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF). A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">The Irish Rovers</span> tickets and their applicable fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
