<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/426801ADCBLCTNGVRNTCDNSRVLDLPNLKH>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "The Sheepdogs";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/973e18bd-6fd0-48e6-9025-6358605318e7.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>Kootenay Concert Connection presents </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">THE SHEEPDOGS</span></h1></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span>The Sheepdogs are Canada's leaders in rock 'n' roll entertainment. Four-time JUNO Award winners from Saskatoon, with multiple Gold and Platinum records to their name, they blend soaring harmonies, dual-guitar wizardry, and a stage presence that turns audiences into true believers.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The Sheepdogs deliver the real goods: rock music that's loud, loose, and full of soul. They've taken their unmistakable sound from bars and roadhouses to festival stages around the world, earning a reputation as one of the most electrifying live bands on the road today. Night after night, they remind audiences that rock 'n' roll isn't something to look back on. It's alive, well, and thriving.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Across 14 releases, including their latest album <span class=\"ItalicText\">Keep Out Of The Storm</span>, The Sheepdogs have built one of the most respected catalogues in modern rock. With their own label, Right On Records, they're firmly in control of their future, continuing to write the next chapter on their own terms. Their reputation has long been established, but every new record and every night on stage proves the same thing: rock 'n' roll is alive and well, and The Sheepdogs are leading the charge.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 1  $73.66</span>  ($62.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $9.30 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 2  $67.91</span>  ($57.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $8.55 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices are in CAD and include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Kelowna Community Theatre event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF). A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">The Sheepdogs</span> tickets and their applicable service fees are non-refundable.</span>
""";
