		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\"><span class=\"BoldText\">This is NOT a ticket to The Sheepdogs concert. You cannot purchase a VIP upgrade without a ticket to The Sheepdogs concert.</span></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">VERY limited VIP packages available!</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The Sheepdogs Gold VIP event is a meet and greet activity prior to the show with the band that includes:<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>- Limited edition vinyl record<span><br/></span>- VIP laminate<span><br/></span>- Photos and 1-1 moments with the band<span><br/></span>- An acoustic performance<span><br/></span>- Game Show Wheel Activites with the band<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">The Sheepdogs Gold VIP Upgrade  $137.50</span>  ($125.00 base price + $12.50 service charges)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices are in CAD and include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">The Sheepdogs Gold VIP Upgrade</span> tickets and their applicable service fees are non-refundable.</span>
