<http://www.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/event/423801APMQHTSHNSDMHSCVPQNVNNBSBTH>
  a schema:Event;
  schema:name "WAR On The Catwalk";
  schema:description """
	<table class=\" BorderOn\">
		<tr>
			<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"1\"><img src=\"https://system.spektrix.com/kelownacommunitytheatre/files/ff93098a-0816-4aec-8394-892d6ff0a20e.jpg\" /> </td><td align=\"left\"><h2>Murray & Peter present </h2><h1><span class=\"UnderlineText\">WAR ON THE CATWALK</span></h1></td>
		</tr>
	</table><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Murray & Peter</span> proudly present the return of, <span class=\"BoldText\">WAR On The Catwalk</span> featuring contestants who appeared on the Emmy-Award winning television show, <span class=\"ItalicText\">RuPaul’s Drag Race</span> on MTV and <span class=\"ItalicText\">Canada’s Drag Race</span> on Crave TV. The tour will travel to 16 Canadian cities; February 11 - March 2, 2027.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Hosted by <span class=\"ItalicText\">Alyssa Edwards</span> (winner of <span class=\"ItalicText\">RuPaul’s Drag Race Global All Stars 2024</span>), the Canadian tour includes performances by… <span class=\"ItalicText\">Myki Meeks, Jane Don’t, Darlene Mitchell, Juicy Love Dion, and Discord Addams</span> from <span class=\"ItalicText\">Drag Race Season 18</span>, plus <span class=\"ItalicText\">Silky Ganache</span> from <span class=\"ItalicText\">All Stars Season 11</span> and <span class=\"ItalicText\">Aurora Matrix</span>, winner of <span class=\"ItalicText\">Canada's Drag Race All Stars Season 1</span>. All queen will perform in all 16 tour cities. <span><br/></span><span><br/></span>A special Add-On ticket is also available for the exclusive meet & greet with the queens on the main stage before the show. Fans who purchase the Add-On ticket will take pics with the queens, score autographs and receive official tour swag. <span class=\"BoldText\">Select during checkout process.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>The 2-hour show includes a 20-minute intermission so fans can purchase merch of their favorite queens. All ages welcome. <span class=\"BoldText\">For more information, visit</span> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.dragfans.com/\">www.dragfans.com</a>. Find Murray & Peter on social media: @mppresent.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Zwcmdj8PgYc\">Check out the tour trailer here!</a></span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><h2>Pricing</h2><span class=\"BoldText\">Front Row  $158.13</span>  ($135.45base price + $2.36 CIF + $20.32 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Second Row  $111.04</span>  ($94.50 base price + $2.36 CIF + $14.18 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 1  $92.92</span>  ($78.75 base price + $2.36 CIF + $11.81 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 2  $74.81</span>  ($63.00 base price + $2.36 CIF + $9.45 service charge)<span><br/></span><span class=\"BoldText\">Tier 3  $56.70</span>  ($47.25 base price + $2.36 CIF + $7.09 service charge)<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">All above prices are in CAD and include GST.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span>---<span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span class=\"ItalicText\">Kelowna Community Theatre event tickets include a $2.36 Capital Improvement Fee (CIF). A service fee is added for box office costs, card processing, and taxes. <span class=\"BoldText\">WAR On The Catwalk</span> tickets and fees are non-refundable.</span>
